ull},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-12-12T23:44:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:25:28Z","closed_at":"2025-04-01T08:02:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3\n4.4-dev6\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.3\n\n### Issue description\n\nTileMap pixel snapping loses precision the further away from the origin you get. Near (0,0) coordinates the TileMap behaves perfectly, for the sake of exaggerating the effect, I've attached a minimal project at ~20,000 tiles from the origin in both x, y direction and the black lines become far more frequent both horizontally and vertically.\n\nIn my personal project the issue occurs at ~1,000 tiles from origin (I'm guessing due to the amount of layers/other sprites?, not sure).\n\nThe issue is still present even with pixel snapping enabled.\n\nPictures: Make sure you open at full resolution\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/352b5bdb-b23b-45ce-81e4-3fd1d996a1d4)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88f34439-150e-4f03-bf56-9c8b4d7b4063)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df925760-c465-49e3-9fbf-7962d2460585)\n\n[![Video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H72fgI7LFZY)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H72fgI7LFZY)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake a TileMap\nMake a Camera2D\nDraw some tiles ~20,000 tiles away from the origin\nSet camera position to those tiles\nAdd some WASD/Arrow key movement and camera zoom functions\nStart project and move around and test different zoom functions\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[tilemap.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18118781/tilemap.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Veradictus","id":45127244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTI3MjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45127244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus","html_url":"https://github.com/Veradictus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Veradictus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100341/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100341/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}